---
description: Applies to Supabase, database, auth, and rating data work
globs:
  - "supabase/**/*.sql"
  - "supabase/**/*"
  - "src/lib/supabase*"
  - "src/features/**/*.ts"
  - "src/features/**/*.tsx"
---

Route Supabase work to the canonical sources instead of repeating schema or
policy defaults here:

- Current task and sequencing: `docs/TASKS.md`.
- Tables, constraints, functions, RLS, and Data API grants:
  `docs/DATA_MODEL.md`.
- Frontend/backend field mappings: `docs/API_CONTRACTS.md`.
- Environment, secret, and production boundaries: `docs/SECURITY.md`.
- Execution routine: `skills/supabase-schema-change/SKILL.md`.

Do not invent or copy a second SQL contract into this rule. Never expose a
service-role key in client code.
